  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for strengthening women and youth participation in municipal budget processes in Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Founded by young people and led by young people, BEOG NEERE&#x2019;s mission is to help build a Burkina Faso where peace, human rights, democracy, and good governance reign. BEOG NEERE&#x2019;s vision is a democratic, free, and prosperous Burkina Faso where all parties, civil society, government, private sector, and citizens all work for a common interest. BEOG NEERE also works to entrench democracy and good governance in Francophone Africa. This grant will enable BEOG NEERE to continue increasing the engagement of young people and women in budget processes and citizen monitoring of budget expenditure at the municipal level in Burkina Faso. (Strategy: Inclusive Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
